Correctness:
- Equality uses a fixed absolute tolerance (HYP_EPSILON, 1E-5 in both precisions): too
  strict for large values (especially in single precision) and too loose for small
  ones (1e-7 and 9e-6 compare equal). Consider relative / ULP-based comparisons.

Long double support (planned):
- A HYPATIA_LONG_DOUBLE_PRECISION_FLOATS mode: HYP_FLOAT long double, HYP_FLOAT_C(x) x ## L
- Needs sinl/cosl/sqrtl/etc. (C99), its own HYP_EPSILON, and hyp_print_value with a
  long double parameter (%Lf)
- long double differs by platform; CI needs a long double job per platform

Docs:
- Publish the Doxygen output (.github/workflows/publish-docs.yml)

